t.", "s": 122.05, "e": 122.37}, {"w": " If", "s": 123.35, "e": 123.83}, {"w": " I've", "s": 123.83, "e": 124.13}, {"w": " got", "s": 124.13, "e": 124.27}, {"w": " this", "s": 124.27, "e": 124.41}, {"w": " right,", "s": 124.41, "e": 124.67}, {"w": " you're", "s": 124.73, "e": 124.99}, {"w": " reading", "s": 124.99, "e": 125.17}, {"w": " this", "s": 125.17, "e": 125.41}, {"w": " letter", "s": 125.41, "e": 125.61}, {"w": " a", "s": 125.61, "e": 125.75}, {"w": " week", "s": 125.75, "e": 125.93}, {"w": " after", "s": 125.93, "e": 126.17}, {"w": " we", "s": 126.17, "e": 126.33}, {"w": " left", "s": 126.33, "e": 126.57}, {"w": " in", "s": 126.57, "e": 126.69}, {"w": " the", "s": 126.69, "e": 126.77}, {"w": " TARDIS.", "s": 126.77, "e": 127.25}, {"w": " The", "s": 127.65, "e": 128.13}, {"w": " thing", "s": 128.13, "e": 128.39}, {"w": " is,", "s": 128.39, "e": 128.61}, {"w": " we're", "s": 128.75, "e": 130.49}, {"w": " not", "s": 130.49, "e": 130.63}, {"w": " coming", "s": 130.63, "e": 130.85}, {"w": " back.", "s": 130.85, "e": 131.07}]}, {"start": 132.27, "end": 145.65, "text": "We're alive and well and stuck. In New York, 50 years before I was born. We can't come home again. I won't ever see you again. And that breaks my heart.", "words": [{"w": " We're", "s": 132.27, "e": 132.75}, {"w": " alive", "s": 132.75, "e": 132.93}, {"w": " and", "s": 132.93, "e": 133.39}, {"w": " well", "s": 133.39, "e": 133.67}, {"w": " and", "s": 133.67, "e": 134.13}, {"w": " stuck.", "s": 134.13, "e": 135.31}, {"w": " In", "s": 136.33, "e": 136.81}, {"w": " New", "s": 136.81, "e": 136.99}, {"w": " York,", "s": 136.99, "e": 137.29}, {"w": " 50", "s": 137.47, "e": 137.95}, {"w": " years", "s": 137.95, "e": 138.21}, {"w": " before", "s": 138.21, "e": 138.45}, {"w": " I", "s": 138.45, "e": 138.73}, {"w": " was", "s": 138.73, "e": 138.85}, {"w": " born.", "s": 138.85, "e": 139.15}, {"w": " We", "s": 140.03, "e": 140.51}, {"w": " can't", "s": 140.51, "e": 140.79}, {"w": " come", "s": 140.79, "e": 140.93}, {"w": " home", "s": 140.93, "e": 141.19}, {"w": " again.", "s": 141.19, "e": 141.39}, {"w": " I", "s": 141.65, "e": 142.13}, {"w": " won't", "s": 142.13, "e": 142.47}, {"w": " ever", "s": 142.47, "e": 142.81}, {"w": " see", "s": 142.81, "e": 143.55}, {"w": " you", "s": 143.55, "e": 143.67}, {"w": " again.", "s": 143.67, "e": 143.91}, {"w": " And", "s": 144.39, "e": 144.87}, {"w": " that", "s": 144.87, "e": 145.03}, {"w": " breaks", "s": 145.03, "e": 145.33}, {"w": " my", "s": 145.33, "e": 145.49}, {"w": " heart.", "s": 145.49, "e": 145.65}]}, {"start": 148.2, "end": 148.86, "text": "I'm so sorry.", "words": [{"w": " I'm", "s": 148.2, "e": 148.68}, {"w": " so", "s": 148.68, "e": 148.76}, {"w": " sorry.", "s": 148.76, "e": 148.86}]}, {"start": 148.86, "end": 166.69, "text": "I'm so sorry, Dad. I thought about this for years. And I realised there was one thing I could do. I could write to you. Tell you everything about how we lived. How, despite it all, we were happy.", "words": [{"w": " I'm", "s": 148.86, "e": 148.86}, {"w": " so", "s": 148.86, "e": 148.86}, {"w": " sorry,", "s": 148.86, "e": 149.14}, {"w": " Dad.", "s": 149.18, "e": 149.34}, {"w": " I", "s": 152.97, "e": 153.41}, {"w": " thought", "s": 153.41, "e": 153.57}, {"w": " about", "s": 153.57, "e": 153.77}, {"w": " this", "s": 153.77, "e": 153.91}, {"w": " for", "s": 153.91, "e": 154.05}, {"w": " years.", "s": 154.05, "e": 154.39}, {"w": " And", "s": 154.99, "e": 155.43}, {"w": " I", "s": 155.43, "e": 156.11}, {"w": " realised", "s": 156.11, "e": 156.59}, {"w": " there", "s": 156.59, "e": 157.11}, {"w": " was", "s": 157.11, "e": 157.31}, {"w": " one", "s": 157.31, "e": 157.49}, {"w": " thing", "s": 157.49, "e": 157.75}, {"w": " I", "s": 157.75, "e": 158.01}, {"w": " could", "s": 158.01, "e": 158.23}, {"w": " do.", "s": 158.23, "e": 158.53}, {"w": " I", "s": 158.83, "e": 159.27}, {"w": " could", "s": 159.27, "e": 159.43}, {"w": " write", "s": 159.43, "e": 159.63}, {"w": " to", "s": 159.63, "e": 159.75}, {"w": " you.", "s": 159.75, "e": 159.91}, {"w": " Tell", "s": 160.73, "e": 161.17}, {"w": " you", "s": 161.17, "e": 161.39}, {"w": " everything", "s": 161.39, "e": 161.95}, {"w": " about", "s": 161.95, "e": 162.45}, {"w": " how", "s": 162.45, "e": 162.71}, {"w": " we", "s": 162.71, "e": 162.85}, {"w": " lived.", "s": 162.85, "e": 163.23}, {"w": " How,", "s": 163.47, "e": 163.91}, {"w": " despite", "s": 164.03, "e": 164.69}, {"w": " it", "s": 164.69, "e": 164.93}, {"w": " all,", "s": 164.93, "e": 165.11}, {"w": " we", "s": 165.27, "e": 166.31}, {"w": " were", "s": 166.31, "e": 166.47}, {"w": " happy.", "s": 166.47, "e": 166.69}]}, {"start": 167.03, "end": 182.92, "text": "But before I do, I need you to know, you are the best dad any son could have had. And for all the times I drove you mad and you drove me mad, all the times I snapped at you, I'm sorry.", "words": [{"w": " But", "s": 167.03, "e": 167.47}, {"w": " before", "s": 167.47, "e": 167.69}, {"w": " I", "s": 167.69, "e": 167.85}, {"w": " do,", "s": 167.85, "e": 168.01}, {"w": " I", "s": 168.13, "e": 168.29}, {"w": " need", "s": 168.29, "e": 168.45}, {"w": " you", "s": 168.45, "e": 168.59}, {"w": " to", "s": 168.59, "e": 168.71}, {"w": " know,", "s": 168.71, "e": 168.89}, {"w": " you", "s": 169.05, "e": 171.01}, {"w": " are", "s": 171.01, "e": 171.25}, {"w": " the", "s": 171.25, "e": 171.39}, {"w": " best", "s": 171.39, "e": 171.71}, {"w": " dad", "s": 171.71, "e": 172.19}, {"w": " any", "s": 172.19, "e": 172.73}, {"w": " son", "s": 172.73, "e": 173.03}, {"w": " could", "s": 173.03, "e": 173.29}, {"w": " have", "s": 173.29, "e": 173.43}, {"w": " had.", "s": 173.43, "e": 173.67}, {"w": " And", "s": 174.43, "e": 174.87}, {"w": " for", "s": 174.87, "e": 175.15}, {"w": " all", "s": 175.15, "e": 175.33}, {"w": " the", "s": 175.33, "e": 175.43}, {"w": " times", "s": 175.43, "e": 175.69}, {"w": " I", "s": 175.69, "e": 175.85}, {"w": " drove", "s": 175.85, "e": 175.99}, {"w": " you", "s": 175.99, "e": 176.19}, {"w": " mad", "s": 176.19, "e": 176.49}, {"w": " and", "s": 176.49, "e": 176.81}, {"w": " you", "s": 176.81, "e": 177.19}, {"w": " drove", "s": 177.19, "e": 177.45}, {"w": " me", "s": 177.45, "e": 177.67}, {"w": " mad,", "s": 177.67, "e": 177.99}, {"w": " all", "s": 178.13, "e": 178.83}, {"w": " the", "s": 178.83, "e": 178.97}, {"w": " times", "s": 178.97, "e": 179.17}, {"w": " I", "s": 179.17, "e": 179.31}, {"w": " snapped", "s": 179.31, "e": 179.49}, {"w": " at", "s": 179.49, "e": 179.71}, {"w": " you,", "s": 179.71, "e": 179.89}, {"w": " I'm", "s": 180.05, "e": 180.87}, {"w": " sorry.", "s": 182.66, "e": 182.92}]}, {"start": 185.55, "end": 189.7, "text": "I miss everything about you. Especially our awkward hugs.", "words": [{"w": " I", "s": 185.55, "e": 185.55}, {"w": " miss", "s": 185.55, "e": 185.55}, {"w": " everything", "s": 185.55, "e": 185.85}, {"w": " about", "s": 185.85, "e": 186.21}, {"w": " you.", "s": 186.21, "e": 186.47}, {"w": " Especially", "s": 186.71, "e": 187.31}, {"w": " our", "s": 188.66, "e": 189.04}, {"w": " awkward", "s": 189.04, "e": 189.32}, {"w": " hugs.", "s": 189.32, "e": 189.7}]}, {"start": 190.14, "end": 195.57, "text": "I've bought a trowel. We have a small yard. I garden.", "words": [{"w": " I've", "s": 190.14, "e": 190.74}, {"w": " bought", "s": 192.43, "e": 192.57}, {"w": " a", "s": 192.57, "e": 192.71}, {"w": " trowel.", "s": 192.71, "e": 193.17}, {"w": " We", "s": 193.35, "e": 193.95}, {"w": " have", "s": 193.95, "e": 194.05}, {"w": " a", "s": 194.05, "e": 194.09}, {"w": " small", "s": 194.09, "e": 194.31}, {"w": " yard.", "s": 194.31, "e": 194.61}, {"w": " I", "s": 194.83, "e": 195.29}, {"w": " garden.", "s": 195.29, "e": 195.57}]}, {"start": 200.9, "end": 207.32, "text": "But one more important bit of business. The man who delivered the letter, Anthony. Be nice to him.", "words": [{"w": " But", "s": 200.9, "e": 201.2}, {"w": " one", "s": 201.2, "e": 201.5}, {"w": " more", "s": 201.5, "e": 201.68}, {"w": " important", "s": 201.68, "e": 202.24}, {"w": " bit", "s": 202.24, "e": 202.46}, {"w": " of", "s": 202.46, "e": 202.48}, {"w": " business.", "s": 202.48, "e": 202.74}, {"w": " The", "s": 203.22, "e": 203.82}, {"w": " man", "s": 203.82, "e": 204.0}, {"w": " who", "s": 204.0, "e": 204.16}, {"w": " delivered", "s": 204.16, "e": 204.44}, {"w": " the", "s": 204.44, "e": 204.66}, {"w": " letter,", "s": 204.66, "e": 204.9}, {"w": " Anthony.", "s": 205.06, "e": 205.58}, {"w": " Be", "s": 206.16, "e": 206.76}, {"w": " nice", "s": 206.76, "e": 207.0}, {"w": " to", "s": 207.0, "e": 207.18}, {"w": " him.", "s": 207.18, "e": 207.32}]}, {"start": 208.9, "end": 210.16, "text": "Because he's your grandson.", "words": [{"w": " Because", "s": 208.9, "e": 209.5}, {"w": " he's", "s": 209.5, "e": 209.76}, {"w": " your", "s": 209.76, "e": 209.82}, {"w": " grandson.", "s": 209.82, "e": 210.16}]}, {"start": 210.5, "end": 233.22, "text": "We finally adopted in 1946. Anthony Brian Williams.", "words": [{"w": " We", "s": 210.5, "e": 210.86}, {"w": " finally", "s": 228.52, "e": 229.04}, {"w": " adopted", "s": 229.04, "e": 229.44}, {"w": " in", "s": 229.44, "e": 230.04}, {"w": " 1946.", "s": 230.04, "e": 230.72}, {"w": " Anthony", "s": 231.9, "e": 232.5}, {"w": " Brian", "s": 232.5, "e": 232.84}, {"w": " Williams.", "s": 232.84, "e": 233.22}]}, {"start": 234.46, "end": 237.22, "text": "He can tell you everything. He'll have the family albums.", "words": [{"w": " He", "s": 234.46, "e": 235.06}, {"w": " can", "s": 235.06, "e": 235.2}, {"w": " tell", "s": 235.2, "e": 235.34}, {"w": " you", "s": 235.34, "e": 235.42}, {"w": " everything.", "s": 235.42, "e": 235.66}, {"w": " He'll", "s": 235.98, "e": 236.34}, {"w": " have", "s": 236.34, "e": 236.46}, {"w": " the", "s": 236.46, "e": 236.58}, {"w": " family", "s": 236.58, "e": 236.92}, {"w": " albums.", "s": 236.92, "e": 237.22}]}, {"start": 237.5, "end": 240.32, "text": "And I realise having a grandson who's older than you...", "words": [{"w": " And", "s": 237.5, "e": 237.74}, {"